                {
                  "question": "How do I book a cleaning service?",
                  "answer": "Send us a message through the contact form below or call us. Tell us the service, date and time that suit you, and our team will confirm your booking."
                },
                {
                  "question": "Are your cleaning products safe?",
                  "answer": "Yes. We use eco-friendly, non-toxic products that are safe for your family, pets and the environment, while still tough on dirt and germs."
                },
                {
                  "question": "Do I need to provide cleaning supplies?",
                  "answer": "No. Our team arrives fully equipped. If you would like us to use specific products, just let us know when booking."
                },
                {
                  "question": "Do you offer same-day cleaning?",
                  "answer": "Yes, subject to team availability. Call us as early as possible and we will do our best to clean the same day."
                },
                {
                  "question": "What if I'm not satisfied with the cleaning?",
